## Decisions and Action Items

* **Candidate Constellation Datasets**: Marc Blanchet (Aerospace Lab) will prepare candidate LEO constellation specifications (200–1,000 satellites) in Constellation Code format and curated ground station datasets for community evaluation.
* **Tool Registry Taxonomy Expansion**: Johann Hugon, Juan Fraire, and Farid Theune will define qualitative evaluation categories (e.g., node limits, packet/message granularity) to qualify entries in the Tooling Registry.
* **Lunar/Deep Space Metrics Alignment**: Felix Flentge (ESA) and SpaceRG contributors will collaborate on defining standardized metrics for Lunar/Deep Space reference scenarios in alignment with TIP-TOP requirements.

